70K@3.5GHz or Ryzen 5 1500X@3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 960 or AMD R9 380<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 42 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K or Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 2060 RTX or AMD RX 5600 XT</li></ul>","genres":["Simulation","Free To Play"],"developers":["Zen Studios"],"publishers":["Zen Studios"],"release_date":"13 Apr, 2023"}